@MEMS.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7249

GET {{MEMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/municipalities
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{MEMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/candidates?municipalitySlug=burnaby&name=reese
Accept: application/json

### Keep the companion cookie and copy requestToken into X-CSRF-TOKEN for unsafe requests.
GET {{MEMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json

### Password/token placeholders must be supplied securely; do not commit real values.
POST {{MEMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: REPLACE_WITH_CURRENT_REQUEST_TOKEN

{ "username": "Super", "password": "REPLACE_WITH_CONFIGURED_PASSWORD" }

### Refresh the CSRF token after login. Your HTTP client must retain the session cookies.
GET {{MEMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json
